Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.27,0:00:25.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serangan acak lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.81,0:00:29.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini mengerikan. Tubuhnya tercabik-cabik.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.24,0:00:34.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu benar-benar perbuatan manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.57,0:00:39.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kudengar korban lain tampak\Nseperti dicabik-cabik oleh hewan liar.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.83,0:00:42.20,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Mungkin anjing liar?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.54,0:00:44.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kagami.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakakmu polisi, kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.38,0:00:49.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada kemajuan dengan penyelidikannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.67,0:00:53.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kata kakakmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.13,0:00:56.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebenarnya…
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.76,0:00:59.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakakku kurang sehat belakangan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.39,0:01:02.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia mungkin harus mengundurkan diri\Ndari kepolisian.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.23,0:01:04.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Apa?\N- Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.56,0:01:06.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu sangat buruk.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.32,0:01:12.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sedang memulihkan diri di rumah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.21,0:02:56.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang, Soma.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.88,0:02:58.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.47,0:03:01.81,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku pulang, Mitsuma, Shizuma.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.51,0:03:04.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana keadaan Kakak?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.81,0:03:06.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini…
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.52,0:03:10.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak, aku sudah pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.57,0:03:22.36,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah di tempat tidur sejak pagi ini
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.78,0:03:23.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.41,0:03:25.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu mengkhawatirkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.62,0:03:31.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nenek memintamu ke kamarnya
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.04,0:03:34.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,begitu kau kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.42,0:03:36.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.72,0:03:44.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nenek, aku baru saja pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.64,0:03:47.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masuklah, Soma.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada hal penting yang ingin kubahas.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.02,0:04:00.78,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya dia tidak cocok lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.99,0:04:02.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.40,0:04:06.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu Kakak?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.74,0:04:09.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.33,0:04:16.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa menggantikan Kakak?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.38,0:04:18.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.88,0:04:22.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau siap untuk itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.01,0:04:26.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu alasanmu memanggilku kemari, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.39,0:04:30.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nenek…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.52,0:04:35.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pembunuhan acak yang dibicarakan\Nsemua orang belakangan ini…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak dalangnya, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tubuh anak itu
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.37,0:04:51.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak bisa menanggung\Nbeban nasib keluarga Kagami.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.54,0:04:59.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku bisa menanganinya lebih baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.89,0:05:08.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu…
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisakah kau membunuh kakakmu dengan ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.85,0:05:17.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.27,0:05:20.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,menggantikannya…
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma…
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak…
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.38,0:05:46.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.55,0:05:48.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.01,0:05:53.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia mendengar kami?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.35,0:05:56.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan pergi sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.36,0:06:07.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Ichima!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah merasa lebih baik?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.95,0:06:11.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.37,0:06:15.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan berpatroli.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.96,0:06:25.21,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Mereka bilang ada mayat\Nditemukan di sini pagi ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.84,0:06:26.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.84,0:06:30.68,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Tampaknya semua jasad ditemukan di area ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu artinya pembunuhnya ada\Ndi dekat sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.43,0:06:37.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao, jika kau menyelidiki ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,apa itu artinya\Nini bukan sekadar penyerang acak?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.40,0:06:42.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.52,0:06:44.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka, itu sebabnya…
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.98,0:06:48.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetaplah di sisiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.66,0:06:51.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia manis sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.70,0:06:52.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.45,0:06:58.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,pastikan untuk mengingat suasana\Ndan aroma tempat seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.04,0:07:00.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pengalaman adalah guru terbaik.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.00,0:07:01.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.04,0:07:03.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh…
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.13,0:07:07.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rupanya ini latihan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.06,0:07:19.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kepala keluarga Kagami mewariskan monster\Nmelalui tubuh mereka selama banyak generasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.89,0:07:24.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka menggunakan monster itu\Nuntuk bawa kemakmuran bagi keluarga kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.86,0:07:29.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakakmu tidak bisa mengendalikannya,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.44,0:07:32.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan kini, dia berkeliaran,\Nmembunuh orang tanpa alasan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.49,0:07:36.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia membunuh Nenek tanpa ragu sedikit pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.29,0:07:39.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jiwanya
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.12,0:07:42.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,telah dilahap oleh monster itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.22,0:08:00.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bukan lagi
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.14,0:08:02.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,kakakku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.57,0:08:11.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.66,0:08:16.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.37,0:08:20.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sungguh akan membunuh kakakmu sendiri?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.91,0:08:22.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kau membunuh inangnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,monster ini
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan berpindah kepadamu, Soma.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.05,0:08:31.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi jangan lakukan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.13,0:08:36.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini jauh melampaui kemampuanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita tidak akan tahu
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.81,0:08:39.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,kecuali aku mencobanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.10,0:08:45.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pergi!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.98,0:08:49.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awas!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini…
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.97,0:09:23.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayakashi ini…
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.10,0:09:27.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ia memiliki energi jahat\Nyang sama dengan Yurako.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.06,0:09:30.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster itu…
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.45,0:09:36.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.53,0:09:39.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayakashi apa itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.16,0:09:42.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu kakakku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.00,0:09:44.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.00,0:09:51.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao, dia terluka parah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.73,0:10:07.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao! Cepat!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.61,0:10:15.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia tertusuk salah satu tentakelnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih ada di dalam.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.47,0:10:45.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.81,0:10:49.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentakel yang tadi ada di dalam tubuhnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.15,0:10:51.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.56,0:10:53.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu hampir menyatu dengannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.07,0:10:57.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayakashi itu memiliki energi jahat\Nyang sama dengan Yurako.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.61,0:11:02.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia terkait dengan Klan Goko?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.41,0:11:08.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada jasad lain yang muncul?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seragam korban…
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.29,0:11:12.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia pasti polisi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.13,0:11:16.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengerikan sekali…
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.17,0:11:17.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.22,0:11:20.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu pria
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.88,0:11:21.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang kemarin.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.80,0:11:24.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, kemungkinan besar dia mati\Nsetelah melarikan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.64,0:11:33.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi ayakashi yang mengambil alih\Nseparuh tubuhnya
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.56,0:11:34.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,menghilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hilang?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkinkah ayakashi itu\Nmeninggalkan tubuhnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.57,0:11:43.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakakku?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.41,0:11:46.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah bangun.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak…
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.54,0:11:51.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa beri tahu kami
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.62,0:11:54.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,apa yang terjadi padamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.21,0:11:57.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini… Siapa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seseorang yang mungkin bisa membantumu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.92,0:12:01.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao adalah onmyoji.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.68,0:12:03.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Onmyoji?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster itu
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,telah diwariskan dalam keluargaku,\Nkeluarga Kagami,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.02,0:12:16.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,dari generasi ke generasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.98,0:12:21.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster?\NApa dia membicarakan ayakashi itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.32,0:12:25.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kakakku tidak bisa\Nmengendalikan monster itu
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.37,0:12:28.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan membunuh banyak orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.49,0:12:32.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu penyerang acak itu adalah kakakmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.58,0:12:34.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.75,0:12:38.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin lebih baik dia mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.71,0:12:43.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mengangkat pedangmu terhadap kakakmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.80,0:12:46.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau berusaha menghentikan kejahatannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.06,0:12:52.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kau membunuh inangnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.73,0:12:55.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,monster ini akan berpindah
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.27,0:12:58.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,kepadamu, Soma.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa monster itu mati bersamanya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.90,0:13:05.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.87,0:13:11.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku mengeluarkan tentakel\Nyang ada di dalam tubuhmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.33,0:13:14.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada di dalam tubuhku?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.00,0:13:18.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentang monster itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.79,0:13:21.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana keluargamu bisa mewarisinya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.17,0:13:24.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entahlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.18,0:13:28.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku hanya diberi tahu\Nbahwa leluhur jauh mendapatkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.51,0:13:31.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkinkah leluhur jauhnya
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.31,0:13:36.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,terkait dengan Klan Goko?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.65,0:13:37.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini…
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Mao,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.48,0:13:42.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau sangat kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.95,0:13:47.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku hampir kehilangan kesadaran,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.74,0:13:48.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku melihatmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.62,0:13:52.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau membelah monster itu\Ndengan satu tebasan.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luar biasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.13,0:14:00.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai aku sekuat dirimu, aku bisa…
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.38,0:14:02.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.88,0:14:08.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mungkin bisa mengendalikan\Nmonster itu dengan baik
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,jika ia masih hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.89,0:14:14.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.10,0:14:17.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia baru saja kehilangan kakaknya,\Ntapi dia…
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.85,0:14:21.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma. Itu namamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.48,0:14:26.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster itu adalah kumpulan energi jahat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.32,0:14:29.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bukan sesuatu\Nyang bisa dikendalikan orang biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai sekarang,\Nkau tidak boleh berurusan dengannya lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.04,0:14:40.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi monster itu milikku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.51,0:14:48.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awasi Soma.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.51,0:14:50.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mau ke mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.89,0:14:52.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan mencari monster itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika monster itu masih hidup
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.56,0:14:57.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan mencari inang berikutnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.52,0:14:58.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma dalam bahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.65,0:15:05.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka masih belum menangkap\Npenyerang acak itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.69,0:15:09.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kudengar mereka bahkan mulai\Nmengirim tentara untuk berpatroli.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, di sinilah
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,kakak Soma tewas.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.87,0:15:20.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika ada jejak monster itu yang tersisa…
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.22,0:15:32.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jimat pelacaknya…
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.60,0:15:37.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seseorang melindungi monster itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.90,0:15:44.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.65,0:15:47.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin ada orang di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.44,0:15:51.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Mao memasang penghalang\Nsebelum dia pergi,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.28,0:15:53.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi kita akan aman di dalam.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.08,0:15:59.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Buka.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.88,0:16:06.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga. Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.17,0:16:07.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.34,0:16:14.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.26,0:16:17.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suara itu…
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.27,0:16:19.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu Kakak.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.64,0:16:22.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Tapi kakaknya sudah meninggal.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.60,0:16:23.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.65,0:16:28.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma, tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.41,0:16:35.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau baik-baik saja, Nona Nanoka?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.49,0:16:36.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.79,0:16:46.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan buka itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.46,0:16:50.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menghilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa aku
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,di rumah?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.00,0:17:31.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.15,0:17:49.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mitsuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.65,0:17:51.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shizuma?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada orang di rumah?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.36,0:17:59.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana adik-adikku?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.66,0:18:04.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga! Nenek!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.17,0:18:09.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak membunuhnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.10,0:18:22.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jasad Nenek hilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.77,0:18:30.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bukan…
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.11,0:18:34.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bukan mimpi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.11,0:18:37.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang masuk ke rumah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.87,0:18:46.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak ada!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.25,0:18:49.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak mungkin! Bagaimana ini bisa terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mencari ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.55,0:18:59.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gulungan monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.14,0:19:01.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.51,0:19:04.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu harta keluarga Kagami!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.89,0:19:06.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini milikku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.02,0:19:09.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Atau lebih tepatnya, milik klan tertentu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.35,0:19:11.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.23,0:19:13.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dahulu,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.57,0:19:15.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rumah Perbendaharaan klan terbakar.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.86,0:19:19.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku memerintahkan beberapa murid juniorku
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.03,0:19:22.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk membawa harta itu keluar.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.99,0:19:24.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.83,0:19:29.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,beberapa harta dicuri dan dibawa pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.83,0:19:31.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salah satu pencurinya
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.29,0:19:35.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah leluhurmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku terkejut keluargamu bisa bertahan
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.42,0:19:42.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,selama ini sambil menggunakan\Nalat terkutuk itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.85,0:19:44.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kebanyakan orang
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.60,0:19:47.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan ditelan energi jahat gulungan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.77,0:19:50.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi sepertinya ada orang\Ndi garis keturunanmu
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.85,0:19:52.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang bisa menahan energi jahat ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.77,0:19:58.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak tidak bisa menahannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.19,0:20:02.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana denganmu, Soma?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.55,0:20:21.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seseorang di dekat sini\Nmenutupi keberadaan monster itu
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan melindunginya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.72,0:20:27.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster itu masih hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.35,0:20:31.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.12,0:20:49.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.29,0:20:53.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Usir!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.73,0:21:15.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.48,0:21:21.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.99,0:21:22.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.28,0:21:25.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka, Otoya,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.86,0:21:27.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,kalian berdua baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.45,0:21:31.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma, wajahmu…
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.04,0:21:35.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak seperti kakakmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.21,0:21:38.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,monster itu tidak mengambil alih tubuhmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.21,0:21:41.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin itu sebabnya aku bisa mengusirnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.26,0:21:43.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu, ini yang dia lakukan kepadamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.34,0:21:49.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tetap di sini sampai aku\Nmenghilangkan sisa energi jahatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.93,0:21:51.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.43,0:21:55.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak punya tempat tujuan lain sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.31,0:21:58.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, apa yang terjadi padamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.94,0:22:02.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ke mana kau pergi setelah itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.86,0:22:05.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masalahnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.65,0:22:07.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku sungguh tidak ingat.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.20,0:22:12.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.95,0:22:16.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,benda mirip penghalang\Nyang membawa Soma pergi…
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.42,0:22:18.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pernah melihatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.13,0:22:20.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benarkah?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:21.17,0:22:25.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ingat saat kau diserang shikigami Logam
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.88,0:22:28.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan dibawa pergi oleh penghalang Hakubi?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.80,0:22:32.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengerti maksudmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.35,0:22:36.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hakubi dan Yurako tampaknya terhubung.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.48,0:22:40.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena monster Soma memiliki\Nenergi jahat yang sama dengan Yurako,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.65,0:22:44.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada kemungkinan besar Hakubi itu terlibat.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.90,0:22:48.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu artinya kau juga dalam bahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:49.24,0:22:50.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.20,0:22:55.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku berniat memutus ikatan\Nantara Soma dan monster itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.92,0:23:03.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soma,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.63,0:23:06.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,kenapa kita tidak mencari tahu
Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.72,0:23:09.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,apakah kau mampu mengendalikan
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.22,0:23:11.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,monster itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.85,0:23:14.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menggunakan Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.19,0:24:50.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya Soma
Dialogue: 10,0:24:50.65,0:24:54.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak berusaha keras\Nmenyingkirkan kutukan monster itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:55.20,0:24:58.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru dia tampak terpesona olehnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.41,0:25:01.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hakubi menyuruhku menggunakannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.12,0:25:03.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu di mana adik-adikku!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:03.87,0:25:06.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang ada dua monster.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:06.75,0:25:08.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:09.00,0:25:11.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus membunuhmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.51,0:25:12.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak akan kubiarkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:13.34,0:25:14.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak akan pernah memaafkanmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.14,0:25:17.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Mempertaruhkan Nyawaku".
